        },
        {
          "text": "Bineensa didiqa ka lafa ira deemu, ato garaani lafa ira lohele yokhaani miila afraanini deemele tokole inyaatina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.41+LEV.11.42",
